The bundled API description is the Tenon Pi v0.1 public contract.
LIBERO acquisition manifests generated by this project retain their upstream
CC-BY-4.0 attribution and source revision. This client does not redistribute
model weights or LIBERO episode payloads.

The data-only running-statistics algorithm and normalization JSON format
are faithfully adapted from Physical-Intelligence/openpi
(src/openpi/shared/normalize.py), licensed under Apache-2.0. The generated
statistics contain only values computed from the user's dataset; this package
does not redistribute OpenPI model weights.

LeRobot v2 metadata sampling and population-statistics aggregation follow
HuggingFace LeRobot (common/datasets/compute_stats.py at
0cf864870cf29f4738d3ade893e6fd13fbd7cdb5), licensed under Apache-2.0.
They operate only on the user's actual stored rows and PNG pixels and are
separate from the OpenPI horizon model-space normalization statistics.
